OL,3,GNEWSA'Unique' Roman artefact on display
OL,4,Aat museum
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn artefact believed to date back to
OL,7,Fthe late Roman period has gone on
OL,8,Fdisplay as part of an exhibition
OL,9,Fchronicling thousands of years of a
OL,10,Fvillage's history.
OL,12,FA carved bone box was unearthed during
OL,13,Fan excavation at Milestone Ground in
OL,14,FBroadway, Worcestershire, and
OL,15,Farchaeologists said they had never seen
OL,16,Fanything like it before.
OL,18,FOn Saturday, the village's museum and
OL,19,Fart gallery launched its Buried Lives:
OL,20,FUnearthing 8,000 Years of Broadway's
OL,21,FHistory exhibition, with the bone box
OL,22,Famong the items on display.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,357,350,200,160,0,100
