OL,3,GNEWSA'Unique' Roman artefact on display
OL,4,Aat museum
OL,5,
OL,6,FLaura Griffin, of Worcestershire
OL,7,FArchaeology, told BBC Hereford and
OL,8,FWorcester: "The box is unique; I
OL,9,Fhaven't found another example of it."
